### 1. Create Timetable
POST {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "CSE Semester 5 Timetable",
  "description": "Academic timetable for semester 5"
}

###

### 2. Get All My Timetables
GET {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 3. Get Timetable By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{timetableId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 4. Update Timetable
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{timetableId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated CSE Semester 5 Timetable",
  "description": "Revised academic schedule"
}

###

### 5. Delete Timetable
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{timetableId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}